# Mandatory workflow for every task

## Before starting any task
1. Read `docs/PROJECT_GUIDELINES.md` fully and follow it (structure, naming, when to create
   components/directives/pipes/services, modern Angular syntax).
2. Read `docs/CHANGELOG.md` to understand what has already been done in the project.

## After finishing any task that changes the project
1. Add a new entry at the **top** of `docs/CHANGELOG.md` (below the template section) using the
   entry template in that file: date, task, every added/modified/removed file with a short reason,
   and notes on decisions.
2. If the task introduced or changed a convention, update `docs/PROJECT_GUIDELINES.md` too and
   mention it in the change log entry.

Pure questions/explanations that change no files do not need a change log entry.
